WEBVTT

00:05:29.763 --> 00:05:34.236
which is that ideas are living entities.

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:36.326
They have consciousness.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.889
They don't have matter.
They can't be seen.

00:05:38.913 --> 00:05:41.053
They can't be felt. They can't be proven.

00:05:41.077 --> 00:05:42.436
But they have will.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.406
And the way I picture it --

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:48.262
and it's sort of whimsical, but I also
have literally based my life on this --

00:05:48.286 --> 00:05:51.445
is that the universe is sort of
swirling with these ideas

00:05:51.469 --> 00:05:52.678
that wish to be created,

00:05:52.702 --> 00:05:55.305
and they're constantly looking
for human collaborators,

00:05:55.329 --> 00:05:58.752
because for some reason, we have
this oddly sensitive consciousness

00:05:58.776 --> 00:06:00.422
that can hear them and find them.